@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Accessibility Statement";
}
<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-4xl">Accessibility Statement</h1>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        <p>We've built this site with a "Skip to main content" link, keyboard-accessible
            navigation and dropdowns, sidebar focus trapping, and visible focus states
            throughout. We're not claiming a specific conformance level (such as WCAG
            2.1 AA) without an independent audit to back it up.</p>
        <p>If something on this site is difficult to use with a keyboard, screen reader,
            or other assistive technology, please let us know via our
            <a asp-action="ContactUs" class="font-semibold text-[var(--vw-accent)] hover:underline">Contact Us</a> page — we'd like to fix it.</p>
    </div>
</div>
